WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.282 --> 00:00:15.423
was spending more time in the attic.

2
00:00:16.724 --> 00:00:19.045
Vinnie and Mandy were getting anxious.

3
00:00:20.786 --> 00:00:23.668
The attic was looking more like a tidy office.

4
00:00:24.988 --> 00:00:28.350
The children were running out of places to hide the album.

5
00:00:28.370 --> 00:00:35.322
"We have to do something," Mandy said as she sat in the kitchen.

6
00:00:36.563 --> 00:00:39.525
Dad was in the attic, setting up his computer.

7
00:00:40.746 --> 00:00:43.348
Suddenly they heard a familiar bark.

8
00:00:43.368 --> 00:00:46.630
"Corky!" yelled Vinnie.

9
00:00:47.791 --> 00:00:50.133
He ran to the front door and opened it.

10
00:00:51.214 --> 00:00:53.896
The next door neighbor stood there with his dog.

11
00:00:53.916 --> 00:00:57.799
"Hey, Vinnie," said the neighbor, smiling.

12
00:00:57.819 --> 00:00:59.460
"Is your dad home?

13
00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:04.582
He promised to drive me to the auto repair shop to pick up my car."

14
00:01:04.602 --> 00:01:07.783
"Dad! Corky's here!"

15
00:01:08.403 --> 00:01:09.964
yelled Mandy excitedly.

16
00:01:11.125 --> 00:01:13.926
The children knew how much Dad loved dogs.

17
00:01:13.946 --> 00:01:16.067
"Hey, Corky!"

18
00:01:16.567 --> 00:01:18.848
Dad said, coming down the stairs.

19
00:01:20.329 --> 00:01:24.851
He petted Corky, and the dog wagged its tail happily.

20
00:01:24.871 --> 00:01:31.941
"Tell your mom I'll be right back," he said to the children, grabbing his car keys.

21
00:01:31.961 --> 00:01:34.242
"Take your time!"

22
00:01:34.922 --> 00:01:36.502
Vinnie and Mandy exclaimed.

23
00:01:37.842 --> 00:01:42.044
As soon as Dad was gone, they ran up to the attic.

24
00:01:43.444 --> 00:01:48.005
Last time, the children had hid the album behind a large plant.

25
00:01:48.025 --> 00:01:53.487
"Whew! It's still here," Vinnie said with relief.

26
00:01:54.647 --> 00:01:55.847
He opened the album.

27
00:01:55.867 --> 00:01:57.628
"Mandy, look!"

28
00:01:58.864 --> 00:02:01.406
They were almost at the end of the album.

29
00:02:01.426 --> 00:02:05.628
"What happens when we get to the last page?"

30
00:02:06.748 --> 00:02:08.269
Mandy asked sadly.

31
00:02:08.289 --> 00:02:12.772
"Let's think about that later," Vinnie said quickly.

32
00:02:13.852 --> 00:02:14.993
He turned the page.

33
00:02:15.013 --> 00:02:18.695
"Wow! What is that?"

34
00:02:19.355 --> 00:02:20.216
Mandy cried.

35
00:02:21.857 --> 00:02:24.038
The photo showed a large temple.

36
00:02:25.039 --> 00:02:27.440
People were walking up its steep steps.

37
00:02:28.732 --> 00:02:30.393
They held glowing objects.

38
00:02:31.553 --> 00:02:34.094
The old man stood watching them nearby.

39
00:02:34.114 --> 00:02:39.316
"It looks like some kind of a parade," Vinnie said.

40
00:02:39.336 --> 00:02:42.157
"I wonder where this is."

41
00:02:43.498 --> 00:02:48.880
Before the children could say another word, they fell down the dark tunnel.

42
00:02:51.721 --> 00:02:54.522
Mandy landed first in some soft dirt.

43
00:02:55.623 --> 00:02:56.883
She took a deep breath.

44
00:02:58.496 --> 00:03:01.938
"Stinky!" she cried, holding her nose.

45
00:03:01.958 --> 00:03:04.680
"Hey! Ow!"

46
00:03:05.381 --> 00:03:06.201
Vinnie cried.

47
00:03:07.002 --> 00:03:11.465
He had hit something hard after his fall down the tunnel.

48
00:03:12.646 --> 00:03:14.427
The children opened their eyes.

49
00:03:15.548 --> 00:03:19.691
Two pairs of big brown eyes looked down at them.

50
00:03:19.711 --> 00:03:22.553
"Uh, hello?"

51
00:03:23.294 --> 00:03:26.396
Mandy said softly to two large oxen.

52
00:03:27.856 --> 00:03:29.718
Vinnie had bounced off an ox!

53
00:03:31.039 --> 00:03:37.764
"This must be some kind of farm," said Vinnie, still rubbing his back.

54
00:03:38.985 --> 00:03:40.327
The children stood up.

55
00:03:41.528 --> 00:03:43.970
They were next to a barn with no walls.

56
00:03:45.110 --> 00:03:47.973
Its straw roof was held up by wooden poles.

57
00:03:49.254 --> 00:03:53.758
Suddenly the ox Vinnie had hit let out an angry snort.

58
00:03:54.919 --> 00:04:00.423
The animal shook its head and began to dig at the ground with one hoof.

59
00:04:01.844 --> 00:04:03.286
The children froze.

60
00:04:04.467 --> 00:04:05.388
Vinnie gulped.

61
00:04:05.408 --> 00:04:09.332
"I think he's getting ready to attack."
